<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,376 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,376 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,376 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX).</p>
